es (StructuredOutputError) and honest-degrade (generic Exception, unchanged). TDD: wrote 4 tests RED-first (1 happy-path + 3 held-out edge/mixed), held out 3 from implementer subagent, subagent implemented against happy-path only, restored held-out set -> all 31 tests in test_review_kernel.py green. Mutation check: disabling empty-detection branch correctly turned 2 held-out tests RED, confirming teeth. Lint+typecheck green. Full test suite (make test) running in background.","timestamp":1784681460684269001},{"author":"Joe Oakhart","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Ticket 1 (1aa8-cdde-4ff6-40d0) landed pipeline complete: full suite green (6740 passed, 36 skipped, 0 failures). Committed 77c717961 with rebar-ticket trailer + DCO sign-off (Change-Id I80a2b4091d829509f4c65f00b0f9fa0387d630e2). Pushed to gerrit refs/for/main -> https://rebar.solutions.navateam.com/c/rebar/+/873 (change 873, status NEW). Awaiting LLM-Review +1 and Verified +1. Proceeding to claim ticket 2 (35d2-8cd6-161c-4e7f) as next stacked leaf while gates run on 873.","timestamp":1784682580780035001},{"author":"Joe Oakhart","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Ticket 2 (35d2, DCO identity-neutral guidance + check_dco_identity.py) implemented, full test suite green (6754 passed, 0 failed), committed 1673206 and pushed to Gerrit change 876 (https://rebar.solutions.navateam.com/c/rebar/+/876), stacked on change 873. Awaiting LLM-Review + Verified on both 873 and 876. Ticket not yet closed pending Verified +1.","timestamp":1784688780326579001},{"author":"Joe Oakhart","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Ticket 1aa8 re-cert round-2 PASSed after: precise 'semantically empty' field-level definition, audit note on shipped ACs 1-5, code_review/plan_review outcome_counts wiring gap spun off as discovered_from follow-up c2c5-53a7-2ce0-4d98, empty-vs-recovered clarification. Claimed, confirmed change 8417c4be4 reachable from HEAD, closed 1aa8-cdde-4ff6-40d0. Ticket 3 (6777) round-3 BLOCK with 2 new findings: AC8 test needs enumerated invariants, and import_ndjson.py silently skips missing ticket_id/ticket_type rather than schema-validating -- remediating now.","timestamp":1784692384967219001},{"author":"Joe Oakhart","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Ticket 3 (6777) round-4 remediation applied: corrected import_ndjson.py's actual silent-skip-with-warning behavior (not schema validation), added --dry-run guidance, enumerated 5 specific invariants for the AC8 doc-consistency test. Launched round-4 review-plan (PID 87110). In parallel, launched first-round plan-review for remaining epic leaves: ticket 4 b24d-a840-ea8a-4a54 (PID 88357, plan-review orchestrator hierarchy-context fix) and ticket 5 fe4c-315c-eab7-43b1 (PID 88358, force-bypasses-gates-not-invariants docs+code fix).","timestamp":1784692462308480001}],"created_at":1784679572222130001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"2e43ba45-460e-4739-be28-5977b1717f17","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"6eca-183e-1cd2-4fb9"},{"link_uuid":"c5d8e8a8-9261-49c9-9533-0c0e0c3052fa","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"55c1-0e70-cd8d-40f5"}],"description":"","env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[["relates_to","55c1-0e70-cd8d-40f5"],["relates_to","6eca-183e-1cd2-4fb9"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":[],"ticket_id":"55c1-0e70-cd8d-40f5","ticket_type":"session_log","title":"Implement Janitor Cleanup 2026-07-19 epic (6eca-183e)","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["f8bb821f-72e7-44a0-aac3-5a441d9f5b97","2e43ba45-460e-4739-be28-5977b1717f17","eccb50cb-bdb4-4a9f-a828-43e05